WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.826
Now build a grouped query for diagnoses with more
than one admission

00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:11.608
Before touching the editor state the grain one row
per diagnosis Then

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:17.070
choose the measure admission count Because the
condition is based on the

00:00:17.096 --> 00:00:22.768
completed count decide whether it belongs in WHERE
or HAVING Use

00:00:22.794 --> 00:00:26.425
the starter code in the browser complete the missing
pieces and run

00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:32.963
it Check that only diagnoses with more than one
admission remain If

00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:36.871
you are practicing in pgAdmin you can copy your
completed query into

00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:42.326
the Query Tool and compare the output Focus on the
sequence group

00:00:42.352 --> 00:00:46.010
first calculate the count then filter the groups
using HAVING
